347		\]
348		where $\tau^X(\cdot)$ and $\tau^Z(\cdot)$ are the generalized Pauli observables acting on $(\C^q)^{\ot M}$; note that the argument of $\tau^X$ is $\mathrm{Dec}(g_Z)$ and the argument of $\tau^Z$ is $\mathrm{Dec}(g_X)$. The map $V_{\mathrm{B}}$, acting on registers $\mathrm{B}\mathrm{B}'\mathrm{B}''$, is defined analogously.
